  <item>
    <title>EP17 辞去教师去农场摘蓝莓?你会怎么选?</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63e77dda0d7e8eaa72642542</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63e77dda0d7e8eaa72642542</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 11 Feb 2023 11:36:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这次我们想聊一聊，当一个你很想要的机会真正来临的时候，为什么大部分人产生的反而是向后退亦或是恐惧心理？这种心理是如何产生的？我们一定要克服它么？还是可以和它共存？</span></p><span></span><p><span>Timeline:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="137">02:17</a> 之前播客中立的目标我们都实现啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="616">10:16</a> Really? 梦想成真你还纠结上了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="776">12:56</a> 面对机会想要退缩，原来我不是一个人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="887">14:47</a> 作为教师的我们，竟还不能克服演讲恐惧？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1341">22:21</a> 是谁造出恐惧这个怪兽的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1816">30:16</a> 嘿，你是不是忘了曾经我们都有直面过恐惧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2090">34:50</a>直面恐惧，谁在帮助我们？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2363">39:23</a> 原来建立直面恐惧的自信，我可以靠自己</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: 我还年轻我还年轻-老王乐队</span></p>]]></description>
