    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lv_yCblpMChaoBtliFnt-vnm0NNu.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltidUaR7h0Lww0MLvuHnsYdYSfMe.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Jollee微泡葡萄酒简化了葡萄酒的入门门槛，在经典葡萄酒的基础上加入天然的花果原料，饮用葡萄酒和听音乐一样简单，不再有压力。另外，邀请了葡萄酒大师Mark Pygott亲自选品调配，在口味上满足了每一款都好喝的超高标准，精致小瓶、亲民定价和更好懂的酒标都让选择葡萄酒变成一件简单的事。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【格格不入 X Jollee】专属福利：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>手淘搜索 </span><strong><span>Jollee葡萄酒</span></strong><span>或复制评论区置顶</span><strong><span>淘口令</span></strong><span>链接</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>￥KTEU2zuon5b￥ <a data-url="https://m.tb.cn/h.UVj5EDE" href="https://m.tb.cn/h.UVj5EDE">m.tb.cn</a>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>以</span><strong><span>129</span></strong><span>元到手价购买Jollee</span><strong><span>经典四瓶装礼盒</span></strong><span>，一次畅享所有口味</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>（券后价格比双十一到手价更低哦）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>领券后</span><strong><span>备注【格格不入】</span></strong><span>下单的购买订单还会随单</span><strong><span>附赠听友专属好礼</span></strong><span>【金属酒石一组】和【木浆棉洗杯擦】一块。（与店铺其他加赠不可同享）</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期节目的评论区</span><strong><span>分享你关于喝酒的故事</span></strong><span>，我们会选出</span><strong><span>3位送出</span></strong><span>价值129元的Jollee风味葡萄酒两瓶装。</span></p><span></span><p><span>timeline:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="200">03:20</a> 酒-助力人生重要时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> 对酒的偏见-彰显权利</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="560">09:20</a> 持“酒”行凶的那些人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> 喝酒的场景总让人担心人身安全</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1000">16:40</a> 下班后的仪式感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1830">30:30</a> 从内向到外向的催化剂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2130">35:30</a> 音乐带来愉悦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2230">37:10</a> 被做饭治愈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2826">47:06</a> 不是对的人但却记住了和他一起的散步</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3029">50:29</a> 因为酒精，我坦白了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3185">53:05</a> 让自己开始无负担享受生活</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: Goodmood-Nabes</span></p>]]></description>
