    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期我们会以两个英语老师的视角，通过分享与5位外教在Cambly英语学习平台聊天的经历，谈谈我们对</span><strong><span>如何学英语的见解、国内外做老师的差异以及“口罩”下全球旅居者的生活状况</span></strong><span>。给现在我们所处的这个封闭的盒子，打开一丝微光。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Cambly拥有45000+持有资格证的外教，可以满足你不同需求的英语学习目标，比如</span><strong><span>雅思托福考试、英文面试、专业领域术语</span></strong><span>学习等等。Cambly的外教的人生经历都十分丰富——</span><strong><span>旅行者、数字游民、瑜伽师、冥想师、运动达人</span></strong><span>等等。她们不光可作为语言学习上的老师，还可以作为经历分享的朋友。</span></p><span></span><p><span>PS：下文有格格不入听友专属免费外教课福利~</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9kb2NpbWcyLmRvY3MucXEuY29tL2ltYWdlL3BFRXZpWG5GaW95MDNCdVd3N2RiT0EuanBlZz93PTc5MyZoPTExMjE=.jpeg"></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9kb2NpbWc0LmRvY3MucXEuY29tL2ltYWdlL21MQ3lwUGVjTlJzQVBxdjFRQW9ldkEuanBlZz93PTc5MyZoPTExMjE=.jpeg"></p><span></span><h2><span>听友福利【Cambly x 格格不入 限时活动】</span></h2><span></span><ol><span>  </span><li><span>现在下载</span><a href="https://apps.apple.com/cn/app/id564024107" data-url="https://apps.apple.com/cn/app/id564024107"><span>Cambly App</span></a><span>或者登陆</span><a href="https://www.cambly.com/signUpFlow?referralCode=ggbr66" data-url="https://www.cambly.com/signUpFlow?referralCode=ggbr66"><span>Cambly网页官网</span></a><span>，注册登陆后输入格格不入的听友专属推荐码</span><strong><span>【ggbr66】</span></strong><span>即可直接获得</span><strong><span>免费20分钟</span></strong><span>外教体验课时！购买月度套餐还可立享</span><strong><span>8折</span></strong><span>优惠！折后算下来平均每天一杯奶茶钱就可以提高英语+排解郁闷。我们还将在评论区</span><strong><span>抽取5位听友</span></strong><span>，</span><strong><span>额外赠送30分钟</span></strong><span>的免费试用时长，大家踊跃发言吧~</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>领取后可直接筛选有空时间并且搜索关键词：IELTS\BUSINESS\MOVIE等感兴趣话题匹配外教进行预约对话~也可以采用Cambly才有的功能：即时通话寻找在线外教进行对话练习哦！</span></li><span></span></ol><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9kb2NpbWc1LmRvY3MucXEuY29tL2ltYWdlLzdwQnMzc0V6RTNoWjJOelk4YnBmRUEuanBlZz93PTE5OTcmaD0yMDU5.jpeg"></p><span></span><p><span>文中提到的外教： 感兴趣的朋友们直接搜外教名字去预约聊天就好啦！推荐给大家～</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9kb2NpbWc0LmRvY3MucXEuY29tL2ltYWdlL1lKUHRSekdqbGtTVUFodm9pQTg2U2cuanBlZz93PTc1MCZoPTc4OA==.jpeg"></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9kb2NpbWcxMC5kb2NzLnFxLmNvbS9pbWFnZS8zNFF0TEZWMjNEd1RDdkdmRDdESFB3LmpwZWc_dz04MjcmaD01MDA=.jpeg"></p><span></span><h1><strong><span>本期timeline:</span></strong></h1><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="250">4:10</a> 请拆监控：下班后瘫在沙发上一直刷手机的是不是你？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">8:30</a> 不知道学什么？学英语一定没错！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1370">22:50</a> 学英语也要讲究“文化适用”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1488">24:48</a> 我们在替国外的同行负重前行，别人替我们岁月静好吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2073">34:33</a> 全球旅居者在"口罩"期间的生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3255">54:15</a> 放弃对短暂刺激上瘾，制定长期目标</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3650">60:50</a> 周计划yyds！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5180">86:20</a> ”老“当益壮的年纪正是学习的好时候</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5230">87:10</a> 不要随世界下沉，专注现充才能做出改变</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：Left Right Left-Charlie Puth</span></p>]]></description>
