    <guid isPermaLink="false">6308aa000d43f7f6306c6961</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 26 Aug 2022 11:09:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家对女英语老师的刻板印象大多都是：精致、漂亮、衣服不重样、爱打扮等等。两位主播作为这个群体中的一员，我们想打破作为女性+英语教师的双重“服美役”禁锢。我们想从无意识的“服美役”到有意识的避免这种价值观对我们的剥削和禁锢，对比前后的意识形态发生了何种改变。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Timeline：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="245">04:05</a> 所谓“化妆自由”背后的逻辑</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>以前无意识的“服美役”：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a> 制造问题使我们容貌焦虑的媒体</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a> 主流审美对“白幼瘦”的追求</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2090">34:50</a> 不自信的嗓音</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2297">38:17</a> 女性服装三件套——高跟鞋，长发和长裙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2680">44:40</a> 特定场合下女性不化妆不打扮等于不礼貌？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>意识到女性在”服美役“后：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3060">51:00</a> 别人的评价与我无关，但你要是骂我我就骂回去</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4210">70:10</a> “好女不过百”？“好男要过18cm”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4330">72:10</a> 勇敢发声，掌握权利</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4650">77:30</a> 解脱束缚，不惧“尴尬”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5110">85:10</a> 不为了政治正确不化妆，也不为了主流审美化妆，以我本为出发</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: what makes you beautiful-- one direction</span></p>]]></description>
