  <item>
    <title>EP10 women keep your heads up</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62bd9aacebfc753783b1f786</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62bd9aacebfc753783b1f786</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 30 Jun 2022 12:44:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好久不见！本来六月初打算更新一期与sex有关的主题，但是反复剪辑多次以后审核依旧不给上架，所以才导致了这么久以来的断更。这一期我们第一次有了听友的投稿，加上最近的恶性事件，我们从投稿、自身，聊到此事件自己和其他人的看法，以及分析此事件发生后对女性进一步的影响。欢迎友好的讨论~</span></p><span></span><p><span>Timeline：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="274">4:34</a> 听友投稿1“手刀狂追性骚扰男的女教师”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="785">13:05</a> 听友投稿2“机智勇敢把猥琐男送进局子”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1269">21:09</a> 拒绝受害者有罪论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1406">23:26</a> 男学生对女学生的伤害</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 即使没有证据也要勇敢向外求助</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1892">31:32</a> Emy在健身房被偷拍并反击的经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2744">45:44</a> 女性的性尊严不被尊重</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2825">47:05</a> 男性能为女性做的小事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2900">48:20</a> 我们能否带入女性让无同理心的男性共情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3089">51:29</a> 为什么性暴力事件一定与男性有关</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3270">54:30</a> 我们对唐山打人事件的讨论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">1:00:00</a> 恶性事件后女性进一步被赶出职场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3900">1:05:00</a> 男性主导的职业女性真的会做的更差吗？</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>BGM: keep your head up princess- Anson Seabra</span></strong></h2>]]></description>
