    <guid isPermaLink="false">627f1b274070a48aa1b578bb</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 14 May 2022 02:59:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>y和Echo都迈入28岁的年纪，曾经被主流审美束缚的我们，现在还有年龄焦虑吗？我们如何看待自己"最美好的年纪"？我们对30岁以后的生活的展望......</span></p><span></span><p><span>BTW听友群终于来了！我们群内见噢~</span></p><span></span><p><span>短短一天群内已满200人不能扫码加入，搜索微信号：GGBR_Emy，备注"听友群"，拉你入群~</span></p><span></span><p><span>Timeline：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">7:00</a> 我们在“最好的年纪”真的好吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="970">16:10</a> 社会环境对男性的“纵容”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1150">19:10</a> 婚姻制度的实质</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1340">22:20</a> 所谓女性的“最佳生育年龄”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1886">31:26</a> 谁没恋爱脑过呢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1992">33:12</a> 诡计多端的男人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2830">47:10</a> 食物链的顶端是姐姐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3930">65:30</a> 不再内耗的人生无比轻松</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4595">76:35</a> 勇敢做一个“普信女”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4620">77:00</a> 无比期待我们的30岁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5520">92:00</a> 科技比男人“好用”</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：7 years-MADILYN/Josh Evans</span></p>]]></description>
