  <item>
    <title>EP05 我们是教师，不是魔法师！（上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/624a9903d01d114df44b14a3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">624a9903d01d114df44b14a3</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 04 Apr 2022 07:06:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>第一期我们对“好工作”的吐槽引发了许多共鸣，所以我们决定再进一步对目前的工作以及教育现状进行思考、讨论、分享。由于要讨（吐）论（槽）的点太多，我们分为了上下两期，分别从——1. 学校对教师矛盾的要求；</span></p><p><span>2. “高级”教师真的高级吗；</span></p><p><span>3. 高压下学生的心理、厌学情绪；</span></p><p><span>4. 老师的真实待遇；</span></p><p><span>5. 给未入职和已入职同行的建议</span></p><p><span>这五个方面进行阐述，如果你也是一名教师，有同感处请让我看到你们的呼声~</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="285">4:45</a> </span><strong><span>1.学校对教师矛盾的要求</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="310">5:10</a> 分数攀比严重</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">6:00</a>“双减”下的减负</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="405">6:45</a> 公开对比成绩</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="437">7:17</a> 考试不叫“考试”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="486">8:06</a>没有回家作业真的减负么</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">9:00</a>没有课桌的宿舍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 导致恶性循环的结果</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 延时服务真的提高学生的学习效率么</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="705">11:45</a> 教师被迫内卷</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="820">13:40</a> “好学生”的无所事事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="880">14:40</a> 一刀切做法的负面效果</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a> 午休时间变为内卷时间</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1160">19:20</a> 所谓“创新”的作业还是抄写</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a>结果是学生能力缺陷</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1230">20:30</a>对学生教育方式受限</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1510">25:10</a> “胆战心惊”的批评学生</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1550">25:50</a>杂事优先于教学</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a>主要负责杂事儿的班主任</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1710">28:30</a> 教学往后放</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> “保姆”角色的班主任</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2030">33:50</a>没有自己生活的班主任</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2180">36:20</a>学校的官僚风气严重</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2200">36:40</a>无意义会议多</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a>过于严格的管理制度</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a>被当做“学生”对待的老师们</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2670">44:30</a>在学生面前被校长羞辱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2800">46:40</a>复读机一样的工作群</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2940">49:00</a>那些无意义的评比</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3105">51:45</a> </span><strong><span>2.高级教师真的高级么</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3128">52:08</a>专业水平堪忧的资深教师</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3310">55:10</a>英语课用 中文授课效率更高？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3360">56:00</a> 所谓“老教师”可能只是井底之蛙</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3480">58:00</a>严厉的班级管理方式是否会压迫学生的个性和创造力</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3840">64:00</a>可能给学生带来的心理阴影</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3900">65:00</a>九年义务教育是为了培养好员工</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4022">67:02</a>没有主体意识的学生是谁造成的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4150">69:10</a>长期性的教学工作，有没有更好的管理方式</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4270">71:10</a>给学生自由的班主任管理下的班级</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4380">73:00</a>入学考试是否可以增加对孩子的性格测试</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4535">75:35</a>未来是否可以考虑家长与老师教学理念的匹配</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4665">77:45</a>缺乏培养学生主体意识教育体制</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4750">79:10</a>鼓励孩子发现自己的爱好</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4870">81:10</a>资深教师对学生区别对待</span></p><p><span>背景音乐：Therefore I am - Billie Eilish</span></p>]]></description>
